sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Razorpay (webhook)
    participant A as API
    participant AL as Audit chain (JSONL)
    participant EC as Evidence Collector
    participant RB as Rebuttal Builder
    participant NG as Narrative Generator
    participant RZ as Razorpay Client (mock/real)

    R->>A: POST /webhooks/razorpay/chargeback (HMAC signed)
    A->>A: verify signature + persist dispute marker
    A->>AL: CHARGEBACK_CREATED (tamper-evident append)
    A->>EC: collect_evidence(transaction_id)
    EC->>AL: read SCORE_DECISION entry (point-in-time payload)
    EC->>AL: read transaction proof, device index, Benford mirrors
    EC->>RB: EvidenceBundle completeness
    RB->>RB: rule-based response type (ACCEPT/REJECT/PARTIAL)
    RB->>NG: narrative prompt (Jinja2 + evidence facts)
    NG-->>RB: narrative or deterministic fallback
    RB->>RB: Razorpay payload (contest + evidence slots)
    RB-->>A: ChargebackRebuttalDocument (draft cached)
    A-->>R: 200 processed (background auto-rebuttal)
    Note over A: submit only via /submit with chargeback:admin
    RZ->>RZ: disputes/{id}/contest (mock fixtures or real API)
